# Biteo Vendor Panel — environment template (root)
#
# This file is a DOCUMENTATION/TEMPLATE ONLY. It is NOT automatically loaded
# by the Flutter application and contains NO real credentials.
#
# Biteo Vendor Panel does not currently load a root `.env` file at runtime.
# Real secrets must be supplied through secure infrastructure, for example:
#   - local secret configuration
#   - CI secrets (e.g. GitHub Actions Secrets)
#   - Firebase Cloud Functions secret / runtime configuration
#
# See docs/environment.md for the authoritative list of configuration values,
# where each value comes from, and how it is consumed.

# Razorpay — used only by the Cloud Functions backend (functions/.env.example)
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=YOUR_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=YOUR_RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET